      descriptionPoints: <p data-start="1438" data-end="1492">Centralize and automate all your transport operations.</p><ul data-start="1494" data-end="1698"><li data-start="1494" data-end="1549">Real-time creation and tracking of transport orders</li><li data-start="1550" data-end="1610">Automatic assignment of driver / vehicle / subcontractor</li><li data-start="1611" data-end="1652">Customer portal for shipment tracking</li><li data-start="1653" data-end="1698">Complete history by order and by customer</li></ul>
