      descriptionPoints: <p data-start="1735" data-end="1791">Optimize every route to reduce costs and meet deadlines.</p><ul data-start="1793" data-end="1989"><li data-start="1793" data-end="1838">Visual route planning by zone and vehicle</li><li data-start="1839" data-end="1889">Load optimization based on capacity and weight</li><li data-start="1890" data-end="1933">Management of customer delivery windows</li><li data-start="1934" data-end="1989">Real-time reassignment in case of unexpected events</li></ul>
