      descriptionPoints: <p data-start="2040" data-end="2091">Anticipate breakdowns and control your fleet costs.</p><ul data-start="2093" data-end="2232"><li data-start="2093" data-end="2140">Mileage and engine-hour tracking by vehicle</li><li data-start="2141" data-end="2184">Automatic preventive maintenance alerts</li><li data-start="2185" data-end="2232">Complete history of interventions and costs</li></ul>
